msgstr "Option"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:193
msgid "``--proto http|tcp|udp``"
msgstr "``--proto http|tcp|udp``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:194
msgid ""
"The protocol of the listener and the servers. The default is ``http``."
msgstr "Das Protokoll des Listeners und der Server. Standard ist ``http``."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:195
msgid "``--tls PEM``"
msgstr "``--tls PEM``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:196
msgid ""
"Terminate TLS with a combined PEM file, or with every ``*.pem`` file of a "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"TLS mit einer kombinierten PEM-Datei terminieren oder mit jeder "
"``*.pem``-Datei eines Verzeichnisses."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:197
msgid "``--tls auto``"
msgstr "``--tls auto``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:198
msgid ""
"Obtain and renew the certificate of each ``--domain`` (section *Automatic "
"HTTPS*). Without ``--bind`` the listener is ``0.0.0.0:443``."
msgstr ""
"Das Zertifikat jeder ``--domain`` beziehen und erneuern (Abschnitt "
"*Automatisches HTTPS*). Ohne ``--bind`` ist der Listener ``0.0.0.0:443``."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:199
msgid "``--domain NAME``"
msgstr "``--domain NAME``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:200
msgid "A host name for ``--tls auto``. May repeat."
msgstr "Ein Hostname für ``--tls auto``. Darf wiederholt werden."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:201
msgid "``--http IP:PORT|off``"
msgstr "``--http IP:PORT|off``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:202
msgid ""
"With ``--tls auto``: the plain listener that answers the challenge and "
"redirects to HTTPS. The default is port 80 on the address of each "
"``--bind``. ``off`` leaves it out."
msgstr ""
"Mit ``--tls auto``: der unverschlüsselte Listener, der die Challenge "
"beantwortet und auf HTTPS umleitet. Standard ist Port 80 auf der Adresse "
"jedes ``--bind``. ``off`` lässt ihn weg."

