msgid ""
"The program ``openssl`` in the ``PATH`` of the daemon, which makes RSA "
"keys. ``sibuna check`` and the start stop with this code when the program "
"cannot be run. We install OpenSSL, or we set ``key`` to ``\"p256\"`` or "
"``\"p384\"``."
msgstr ""
