"``key``: ``\"p256\"``, ``\"p384\"``, ``\"rsa2048\"``, ``\"rsa3072\"`` "
"oder ``\"rsa4096\"``. Ein RSA-Schlüssel braucht das Programm ``openssl``."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:962
msgid ""
"``on_demand`` in a site, ``on_demand_tls { ask URL }`` in the global "
