#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1092
msgid ""
"Serve HTTP on event-driven workers, one per processor (SID 0016). "
"``false`` serves each connection on a thread of its own. Platforms other "
"than Linux always use threads."
msgstr ""
"HTTP auf ereignisgesteuerten Workern bedienen, einer pro Prozessor (SID "
"0016). ``false`` bedient jede Verbindung in einem eigenen Thread. Andere "
"Plattformen als Linux verwenden immer Threads."

