"The threads that accept and refuse connections: one per CPU, at most "
"four, by default. From 1 to 64."
msgstr ""
"Die Threads, die Verbindungen annehmen und abweisen: standardmäßig einer "
"pro CPU, höchstens vier. Von 1 bis 64."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1588
msgid ""
