msgstr "``sibuna_edge_forward_active``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2128
msgid "1 while this node forwards. 0 while its mesh is alone or wide apart."
msgstr ""
"1, solange dieser Knoten weiterleitet. 0, solange sein Mesh allein oder "
