#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2626
msgid ""
"Long polls of 25 s, chunk uploads of 16 MiB, large downloads, health at "
"``/healthz``. One coordinator only, so one server. The public URL must be "
